# RPS-2170: the build context is the repository root, so this is an allow-list (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the root .dockerignore): the core submodule, the root and libs
# POMs, .mvn (the compiler flags), libs/scanner-client and the service itself, nothing else.
*
!core
!.mvn
!pom.xml
!libs/pom.xml
!libs/scanner-client
!repsy-scanner-trivy

**/target
**/.git
**/*.iml
